    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-Create Telecom Sim Swap-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom Sim Swap API facilitates the bulk processing of SIM card swaps in the telecommunications sector. Designed for service providers, it allows for seamless updates to customer records as users transition to new SIM cards. This operation primarily handles the creation of swap requests for multiple SIMs, streamlining the management of customer accounts. Typical use cases include ensuring continuity of service and managing customer transitions during network upgrades. This API serves telecommunications companies looking to enhance their operational efficiency and customer service.",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
